  "goodToKnow": "Das Konfetti is confetti, thrown at Karneval (Fasching), weddings and New Year parties. In Austria it's sometimes der Konfetti. The Italian word originally meant sugared sweets thrown during carnival, later replaced by paper. Die Luftschlange is a paper streamer. It has no plural. Many places now ban plastic confetti for environmental reasons."
